sweet: RPMh bus-clock-manager votes for surya (memory bandwidth)

The RPMh client (0062) only knew the PM6150L L11C rail. surya adds
sweet_rpmh_bcm_vote(): cmd-db lookup of BCM resources (slave 5) and one
ACTIVE TCS with their TCS commands (Linux bcm-voter's BCM_TCS_CMD: commit,
valid, vote_x, vote_y), through the same TCS path as the rail vote.
bsd/dev/sweet_touch.c (0900) asks the top votes for MC0 (DDR), ACV and
SH0 (LLCC) with boot-arg suryaddr=1; nothing is voted otherwise.
